#: ../../collectives/index.rst:3
msgid "Collectives"
msgstr "Comhchoistí"

#: ../../collectives/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"Your space to collaboratively write and organize. Collectives is designed "
"for groups and communities to structure shared knowledge."
msgstr ""
"Do spás féin chun scríobh agus eagrú a dhéanamh i gcomhar le daoine eile. Tá"
" Collectives deartha do ghrúpaí agus do phobail chun eolas comhroinnte a "
"struchtúrú."
